            "notes": "# \u2b50 Powers:\n [Threads of Fate](item_cb61612b-9d83-49a9-989d-013bf084fbcb): I feel this is a mandatory round 1 power choice, it helps you gain the max amount of cash as possible for the first few rounds, cash is important in this build as you want to maximize the amount of healing, while saving some slots for movement abilities too.\n\n----------------\n\n# \u2b50 Items:\n [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) \n\n [Weapon Grease](item_961ae72f-434f-406b-a89b-ab8efec806bf) \n\n [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0) \n\n\nTaking any other items would not benefit mercy, as AP does not suit this build and lifesteal is not useful as we aren't using our blaster.",
