            "notes": "# \u2b50 Items:\n [Advanced Nanobiotics](item_26fcf7c9-b81a-4d8e-a459-b515519cb73e) \n\n [Talon Modification Module](item_c0ca1795-a3ea-4dc9-ae17-f34122574b3a) \n\nThese maximize our healing output for a small amount of cash. these two combined are similar to  [Amari's Antidote](item_67e0b1c5-3bcb-4ab5-b818-5082e5706124) therefore we take this as soon as possible\n\n----------------\n\n# \u2b50 Optional Items (Extra Cash):\n [First Aid Kit](item_0172eaaa-1902-44a3-b989-d12f0f7301da) \n\n [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n\n [Adrenaline Shot](item_ab8eba6a-0bda-4b12-8854-4ba4169b515f) \n\n [Siphon Gloves](item_099f8177-c2a4-4e13-b321-99349f8b1eb7) \n\nWith any leftover cash, buy as many common survival items that give [25 Health/Armour/Shields] as this gives you a little more survivability with your healing output being more then enough for round 2.",
