            "notes": "# \u2b50 Powers:\n [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) : We take this power round 3 to help our teammates with a little extra healing, this can be a little bit finicky to use, but once you get the hang of it it is great and you can really notice a difference.\n\n [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) : This is the optional power for round 3, take this item if you feel you are dying more often, or your tank/teammates are surviving just fine without the extra healing from  [Triage Unit](item_fec0554c-2685-4b93-822d-bf0020e654b4) \n\n----------------\n\n# \u2b50 Items:\n [Booster Jets](item_a291de85-b6d9-43cf-b5da-f3184a156f48) : We take this for the weapon speed to increase our healing output, and the extra movement speed is useful for getting out of tricky situations, especially against a  [Junkrat](hero_3ac20f6c-2bce-45f3-998e-9129cc6e5c05) or  [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424)",
