            "notes": "# \u2b50 Powers:\nI have two different playstyles to recommend for round 5+ depending on what your team would benefit from most.\n\nOption 1:  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1) This power gives you that little bit of extra survivability, by this round the enemy team has worked out you are the teams lock and key and need to get rid of you, if you feel like on round 5 you will be targeted more or are getting targeted, please pick serenity and pair it with  [Blessed Boosters](item_957fd380-b7b4-40d4-8333-bb8c535ca931) If they have a  [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424) or  [Junkrat](hero_3ac20f6c-2bce-45f3-998e-9129cc6e5c05) It might be best not to pick serenity, however if their large burst damage abilities don't seem to be affecting you too much and the rest of their team is, this is still a viable pick.\n\nOption 2:   [Crepuscular Circle](item_c0b93ed2-b692-44d5-a38a-ce5a63e83cdb) If you feel like you need that extra boost with ur ult to get that extra uptime of dmg boost and healing, pick this option! However if you feel like your health is geting deleted quickly, it might be suitable to pick  [Serenity](item_c6e1c072-ff50-467e-b59f-9506baea10c1)",
